            <div class="font-bold text-[#121212]">CURRENT EMPLOYMENT</div>
            <div class="text-[#555]">Techants Solutions Pty Ltd</div>
            <div class="text-[#002aff] font-bold">Oct 2022 &ndash; Present</div>
            <p class="text-[#666] pt-1">Co-leading a 10+ member service desk team and coordinating delivery across 25+ enterprise IT client accounts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

