          </p>
          <p>
            Before Techants, I built my troubleshooting and infrastructure fundamentals as a Support Engineer at Cobait Dhaka and an IT Executive at AQSBD.
          </p>
          <p>
            I hold Microsoft's <strong class="text-[#002aff]">Endpoint Administrator (MD-102)</strong> and <strong class="text-[#002aff]">Modern Desktop Administrator (MD-100)</strong> certifications, and I've extended that foundation with self-directed work in Python, Linux administration, and agentic AI.
          </p>
        </div>

